Package: piewifi
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: base-files (>= 8), blueberry-pie-os-kernel (>= 12377.121.6+pie8), kext-tools (>= 2),
 openssl (>= 3.5.9), pie-firmware-brcm (>= 20261019+ds1-1), pie-firmware-brcm (<< 20261019+ds2~)
Description: WiFi station stack and Raspberry Pi 4 and 500 driver
 PIE80211Family.kext provides the station wireless stack and WPA2-PSK
 with CCMP. PIEbwfm.kext drives the CYW43455 on the Raspberry Pi 4 and 500.
 The pie-wifi command manages networks, country settings and link status.
 The piewifi-rtw88 package adds the RG353V driver.

Package: piewifi-rtw88
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: piewifi (= ${binary:Version}),
 blueberry-pie-os-kernel (>= 12377.121.6+pie10),
 pie-firmware-rtw88 (>= 20261019+ds1-1), pie-firmware-rtw88 (<< 20261019+ds2~)
Description: Experimental WiFi for the RG353V
 PIErtw88.kext provides an experimental RTL8821CS backend for the
 RG353V internal SDIO slot with conservative initial power limits.
